@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180

### List companies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies

### Create company
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FPT Software",
  "website": "https://fptsoftware.com",
  "country": "Vietnam"
}

### Get a missing company
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Check Crawl4AI Local
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/crawler-status

### Queue bounded Deep Research (replace the company ID with an existing company)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deep-research
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What evidence describes this company's products and markets?"
}

### Poll a Deep Research run
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deep-research-runs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List saved company research
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/saved-research

### Save a completed server-owned Deep Research run
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/saved-research
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deepResearchRunId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "title": "Products and markets investigation"
}
